MForce Update Center — Educational Purpose / Professional Usage

Updates MForce to the latest official commit on the main branch.
Requires Git, Python 3, a clean working tree and an official origin remote.
The updater refuses detached HEAD, other branches, diverged histories,
local changes and non-official remote URLs.

Usage:
  bash src/functions/upd501.sh --check
  bash src/functions/upd501.sh
  bash src/functions/upd501.sh --yes

Update is a Git fast-forward, never a force reset.
Progress animation is indeterminate, not a fake percentage.
Restart the framework after successful update.
